            "referenceText": {
                "ga": "Leasuithe \u00f3n gCoiste Freagrach - v\u00f3t\u00e1il ar leithligh",
                "nl": "amendementen van de bevoegde commissie \u2013 aparte stemming",
                "ro": "Amendamente ale comisiei competente - vot separat",
                "et": "Vastutava komisjoni muudatusettepanekud \u2013 eraldi h\u00e4\u00e4letus",
                "lt": "Atsakingo komiteto pakeitimai - Atskiras balsavimas",
                "el": "\u03a4\u03c1\u03bf\u03c0\u03bf\u03bb\u03bf\u03b3\u03af\u03b5\u03c2 \u03c4\u03b7\u03c2 \u03b1\u03c1\u03bc\u03cc\u03b4\u03b9\u03b1\u03c2 \u03b5\u03c0\u03b9\u03c4\u03c1\u03bf\u03c0\u03ae\u03c2 - \u03c7\u03c9\u03c1\u03b9\u03c3\u03c4\u03ae \u03c8\u03b7\u03c6\u03bf\u03c6\u03bf\u03c1\u03af\u03b1",
                "hu": "Az illet\u00e9kes bizotts\u00e1g m\u00f3dos\u00edt\u00e1sai \u2013 k\u00fcl\u00f6n szavaz\u00e1s",
                "sl": "predlogi sprememb pristojnega odbora \u2013 lo\u010deno glasovanje",
                "fi": "asiasta vastaavan valiokunnan tarkistukset \u2013 erillinen \u00e4\u00e4nestys",
                "pt": "Altera\u00e7\u00f5es da comiss\u00e3o competente - vota\u00e7\u00e3o em separado",
                "es": "Enmiendas de la comisi\u00f3n competente - votaci\u00f3n por separado",
                "sk": "PN gestorsk\u00e9ho v\u00fdboru - oddelen\u00e9 hlasovanie",
                "fr": "Amendements de la commission comp\u00e9tente - vote s\u00e9par\u00e9",
                "de": "\u00c4nderungsantr\u00e4ge des federf\u00fchrenden Ausschusses \u2013 gesonderte Abstimmung",
                "en": "Amendments by the committee responsible \u2013 separate vote",
                "hr": "Amandmani nadle\u017enog odbora \u2013 odvojeno glasovanje",
                "sv": "\u00c4ndringsf\u00f6rslag fr\u00e5n ansvarigt utskott \u2013 s\u00e4rskild omr\u00f6stning",
                "it": "Emendamenti della commissione competente \u2013 votazione distinta",
                "da": "\u00c6ndringsforslag fra det kompetente udvalg \u2013 s\u00e6rskilt afstemning",
                "lv": "Atbild\u012bg\u0101s komitejas groz\u012bjumi \u2014 atsevi\u0161\u0137a balso\u0161ana",
                "bg": "\u0418\u0437\u043c\u0435\u043d\u0435\u043d\u0438\u044f, \u0432\u043d\u0435\u0441\u0435\u043d\u0438 \u043e\u0442 \u0432\u043e\u0434\u0435\u0449\u0430\u0442\u0430 \u043a\u043e\u043c\u0438\u0441\u0438\u044f - \u0433\u043b\u0430\u0441\u0443\u0432\u0430\u043d\u0435 \u043f\u043e\u043e\u0442\u0434\u0435\u043b\u043d\u043e",
                "pl": "Poprawki komisji przedmiotowo w\u0142a\u015bciwej \u2013 g\u0142osowanie odr\u0119bne",
                "mt": "Emendi tal-kumitat responsabbli - votazzjoni separata",
                "cs": "pozm\u011b\u0148ovac\u00ed n\u00e1vrhy p\u0159\u00edslu\u0161n\u00e9ho v\u00fdboru \u2013 odd\u011blen\u00e9 hlasov\u00e1n\u00ed"
            }
        }
